      "briefing": "The fuel store holds several kinds of gas. Check the highlighted inventory slot before pressing Enter; Shift changes it. Hydrogen clears the first bulkhead. Leave the bomb behind and get clear. Collect nitrogen before helium, then change the selected slot to inflate. The ventilation shaft leads to a second bulkhead; nitrogen has a much larger blast."
