      "briefing": "Bats have occupied the cargo atrium. Jump to bring your pellets up to their height. Little spores have occupied the ducts, and Mama is guarding the greenhouse. A pellet rests a bat; baby spores need one hit, Mama needs ten. Crouch to line up a shot at the little ones. Bring the greenhouse key back to the airlock."
